+    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------
+    // Stage 1: preliminary snapshot. Matrix only, taken as soon as the gate
+    // passes. It is explicitly NOT paired with any test point and must not be
+    // combined with the paired block below if the frames differ.
+    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------
